| `src/persistence/` | bifrost-trade-core | `bifrost_core.persistence` |
| `src/portfolio/` | bifrost-trade-core | `bifrost_core.portfolio` |
| `src/monitor/` | bifrost-trade-core | `bifrost_core.monitor` |
| `src/ib_operator/` (client) | bifrost-trade-core | `bifrost_core.ib_operator` |
| `src/daemon/` | bifrost-trade-worker | `bifrost_worker.daemon` |
| `src/vendor/ib_ingestor/` | bifrost-trade-ib-edge | `bifrost_ib_edge.ingestor` |
| `src/vendor/ib_account_agent/` | bifrost-trade-ib-edge | `bifrost_ib_edge.account_agent` |
| `src/ib_operator/` (service) | bifrost-trade-ib-edge | `bifrost_ib_edge.operator` |
| `backend/*/` | bifrost-trade-api | `bifrost_api.*` |
| `src/bars/`, `src/workers/` | bifrost-trade-worker | `bifrost_worker.celery`, `bifrost_worker.data`（IB bars / Celery；不含 Polygon Massive） |
